  "text": "Build custom lab order panels and requisition bundles\n\nStreamline frequent lab orders by grouping multiple tests into a single reusable panel. Only users with clinical administrator roles can create and publish shared panels for the practice.\n\n1. Navigate to **Clinical Setup > Lab Management > Order Panels**.\n2. Click **Create New Panel** in the top right corner.\n3. Enter a descriptive **Panel Name** and select the applicable clinical specialty.\n4. Use the search bar to locate and add individual tests from the master catalog.\n5. Click **Save and Publish** to make the bundle available to your provider group.\n\n### Limits and Conditions\n* Panels are limited to a maximum of 25 individual tests.\n* Custom panels cannot override specific external reference laboratory coding requirements.\n\n### Troubleshooting\nIf providers cannot view the new panel in their order menu, verify that the panel's sharing permissions are assigned to their specific department under **Settings > Permissions > Lab Access**."
 },
